# A save from the first release becomes the first world: everything kept in the front corner,
# the old pieces still unlocked, a welcome card, and the old file kept under a new name. Its
# visitors and nooks already make four pages, so the west meadow opens at once with its reveal
# (12 pieces besides the 31 old ones).
expect stage 1
expect count all 43
expect item @35,35 cottage
wait 2
expect toast yes
# The welcome card takes its turn among the other toasts (QA2-04).
waitfor 600 toast Welcome back
shot shots/migrated_v1.png
wait 3
expect saved yes
expect file corner.json no
expect file corner.v1.json yes
expect file worlds/laeticias-corner/thumb.png yes
expect file profile.json yes
expect muted yes
quit
